Description: 4k Intro for Linux, released in 2004
 Wave Traveler is a 4k intro by Francois Chazal, released in 2004.
 It shows wavelength interferences, computed in real time with SDL,
 after a small loading screen.
 .
 Press any key or close the window to quit.
